I am in the bus now.
There are many people in the bus.
One seat near the window is empty.
I sit there.
Now the bus conductor comes near me.
He asks - "Madam, where are you going?"
I say - "Brother, please give one ticket."
He says - "Twenty rupees."
I give twenty rupees.
He gives me the ticket.
I put the ticket in the bag.
Now the bus goes forward.
I look outside from the window.
There is a heavy crowd of vehicles on the road.
It is always like this in Mumbai city in the morning.
I travel peacefully.
